<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>
<simplesect><title>template&lt;class TNodeType&gt;<?linebreak?>class Assimp::TXmlParser&lt; TNodeType &gt;</title></simplesect>

<para>The Xml-Parser class. </para>



<para>Use this parser if you have to import any kind of xml-format.</para>

<para>An example: <literallayout><computeroutput><link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_t_xml_parser_1a5af7c6b3f5e9ba39d7f5e026f1e71114">TXmlParser&lt;XmlNode&gt;</link>&#32;theParser;
<emphasis role="keywordflow">if</emphasis>&#32;(theParser.parse(fileStream))&#32;{
&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;<emphasis role="keyword">auto</emphasis>&#32;node&#32;=&#32;theParser.getRootNode();
&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;<emphasis role="keywordflow">for</emphasis>&#32;(&#32;<emphasis role="keyword">auto</emphasis>&#32;currentNode&#32;:&#32;node.children())&#32;{
&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;<emphasis role="comment">//&#32;Will&#32;loop&#32;over&#32;all&#32;children</emphasis>
&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;}
}
</computeroutput></literallayout> 
